        "question_id": "3a5c286c-46e6-4f4b-afe7-25e490acc377"
      },
      {
        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Please examine whether age (x) is linearly associated with systolic blood pressure (SBP, y)."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "Patient",
              "Age (x, years)",
              "SBP (y, mmHg)"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "1",
                "20",
                "118"
              ],
              [
                "2",
                "25",
                "121"
              ],
              [
                "3",
                "30",
                "127"
              ],
              [
                "4",
                "35",
                "130"
              ],
              [
                "5",
                "40",
                "135"
              ],
              [
                "6",
                "45",
                "142"
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "right",
              "right"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(1) Please define your model ${y = bx + a}$. \n(2) Please use F-test to determine if age is significantly associated with SBP (alpha = 0.05)."
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(1) 模型 $y_i=a+bx_i+\\varepsilon_i$, 拟合式 $\\hat y=98.190476+0.942857x$\n\n(2) $S_{xx}=437.5$, $S_{xy}=412.5$, $SST=394.833333$, $SSR=388.928571$, $SSE=5.904762$. $H_0:b=0$, $H_1:b\\ne0$, $F=SSR/[SSE/(6-2)]=263.467742\\approx263.47$, $df=(1,4)$. 临界值 7.7086, 拒绝 $H_0$, 年龄与 SBP 有显著线性关联"
          }
        ],
        "explanation": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "斜率 $b=S_{xy}/S_{xx}$, 截距 $a=\\bar y-b\\bar x$; F 检验基于独立, 同方差, 正态误差的线性模型"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
          {
